1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:14,220
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is October thirty-first. A weather company has released its forecast for the best time to see autumn leaves. Let's listen.

2
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,771
